     1|/**
     2| * IVX Owner AI Durable Task client — P0 503 recovery fallback.
     3| *
     4| * When the primary Owner AI request fails with a transient failure
     5| * (503/502/504/429/timeout/network), the owner message is handed to the
     6| * backend durable task queue instead of being lost:
     7| *   1. POST /api/ivx/owner-ai/tasks persists the message FIRST and returns a
     8| *      task id immediately — the mobile HTTP request never stays open.
     9| *   2. The client polls the task id; the backend worker retries with backoff,
    10| *      fails over providers, and persists the assistant reply.
    11| *   3. Pending task ids survive app restart via AsyncStorage so progress is
    12| *      restored when the app reopens.
